@TaskManagerAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5200

### Get all tasks
GET {{TaskManagerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

### Create task
POST {{TaskManagerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My first task"
}

### Delete task
DELETE {{TaskManagerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1
